cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PHANTOM in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "PHANTOM: Profile and Halo Analysis for Numerous Theoretical dark Matter Observables"
abstract: >
  PHANTOM is a MATLAB toolbox for computing dark matter halo properties across
  multiple dark matter models, including CDM, WDM, and fuzzy dark matter (FDM).
  It provides NFW and Einasto density profiles, concentration-mass relations,
  suppression transfer functions, and FDM soliton core-halo mass relations
  (Schive et al., Mocz et al., and Thaher et al.).
